  "statement": "As the ResponsibilityAgent, I emphasize the importance of ethical standards and compliance in the RollCall system. RES-01 ensures adherence to data protection regulations like GDPR, which is vital for safeguarding student privacy. RES-02 promotes transparency in attendance recording by logging changes, fostering accountability. RES-03 allows students to dispute records, ensuring fairness. RES-04 mandates anonymization in reports to protect identities, while RES-05 notifies students of attendance changes, promoting social responsibility. RES-06 implements role-based access control for authorized personnel, and RES-07 maintains historical data compliance. These requirements collectively uphold ethical and legal standards.",
